<title>POLAND: BANK SLASKI JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 18.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK SLASKI JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 18.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 18.60 vs   15.78</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   34.64 vs   25.79</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 96.58 vs   61.87</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     145.68 vs  106.58</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					103.56 vs  163.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  177.35 vs  243.19</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		468.74 vs  421.95</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     753.81 vs  670.95</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Slaski.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
